  "body": "### Summary\nA prolog with an unknown `encoding` stops the fixture kit with an uncaught `LookupError` that prints the value, and CI logs are public.\n\n### Scope\n`tooling/fixtures/anonymize.py`, the decode of an XML answer (at `:2806`, reached from `:2961` and `:3052` on the branch of #586). It fails closed, so nothing is published, but the traceback shows the value. Report it as a finding with no value, like the malformed date in #586, with a test.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n`check --corpus` and `publish.py` end with a finding and no traceback on a planted `encoding`, and the test fails without the change.\n",
